{"code":"N2","wikidata":"Q15139351","wikipedia":{"en":"Phaya Thai station","th":"สถานีพญาไท"},"summary":{"en":"Phaya Thai station is a rapid transit station on the Airport Rail Link, BTS Sukhumvit Line and a railway halt on the Eastern Line in Ratchathewi District, Bangkok, Thailand. The Airport Rail Link station is located above the intercity Eastern Line at a level crossing on Phaya Thai Road. The station is surrounded by the government buildings, office towers and condominiums along Phaya Thai and Si Ayutthaya Road.","th":"สถานีพญาไท เป็นสถานีในเขตราชเทวี กรุงเทพมหานคร ในเส้นทาง"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/BTS_PhrayaThai.JPG/960px-BTS_PhrayaThai.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_PhrayaThai.JPG","author":"Nutnano","license":"Public domain"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/BTSPYTSign.jpg/960px-BTSPYTSign.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTSPYTSign.jpg","author":"Natnano,Somkidlanna","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Escalator_to_Platform_2_at_Phaya_Thai_BTS_Station.jpg/960px-Escalator_to_Platform_2_at_Phaya_Thai_BTS_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Escalator_to_Platform_2_at_Phaya_Thai_BTS_Station.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Exterior_of_Phaya_Thai_BTS_Station.jpg/960px-Exterior_of_Phaya_Thai_BTS_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Exterior_of_Phaya_Thai_BTS_Station.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC B